 "remarks": "WELCOME TO 27 HACKETT CIRCLE NORTH!! BLENDING CLASSIC CHARM WITH MODERN AMENITIES. THIS CHARMING 1930'S COLONIAL IS LOCATED IN A DESIRABLE GLENBROOK NEIGHBORHOOD. THE WONDERFUL FLOW FOR ENTERTAINING OR FAMILY LIVING BOASTS A LIVING ROOM WITH FIREPLACE, UPDATED KITCHEN WHICH OPENS TO THE DINING ROOM AS WELL AS THE FAMILY ROOM WITH LOTS OF SHELVING AND STORAGE. THERE IS ALSO AN OFFICE, PERFECT FOR WORK AT HOME OR GUEST ACCOMODATIONS, PLUS A FULL BATH TO COMPLETE THE MAIN LEVEL. UPSTAIRS ARE 3 BEDROOMS AND A FULL BATH.  WONDERFUL FENCED YARD WITH DECK AND PATIO COMPLETE WITH GARDENS FOR PARTIES AND OUTDOOR FUN. CONVENIENTLY LOCATED TO SHOPPING, RESTAURANTS, TRANSPORTATION AND HOUSES OF WORSHIP.",
